ygon</span></span></td><td><span><span>300,000</span></span></td></tr><tr><td><span><span>수평선</span></span></td><td><span><span>Polyline</span></span></td><td><span><span>250,000</span></span></td></tr><tr><td><span><span>섬</span></span></td><td><span><span>Polygon</span></span></td><td><span><span>80,000</span></span></td></tr><tr><td><span><span>해안선</span></span></td><td><span><span>Polyline</span></span></td><td><span><span>10,000</span></span></td></tr><tr><td><span><span>기타 구조물</span></span></td><td><span><span>Polygon</span></span></td><td><span><span>200</span></span></td></tr><tr><td><span><span>부두</span></span></td><td><span><span>Polygon</span></span></td><td><span><span>500</span></span></td></tr><tr><td><span><span>암초</span></span></td><td><span><span>Polygon</span></span></td><td><span><span>300</span></span></td></tr></tbody></table></li></ul><p></p><ul><li>객체 이미지 <table><caption>구축 내용 및 제공 데이터량 표-객체</caption><thead><tr><th><span><span>대분류</span></span></th><th><span><span>클래스</span></span></th><th><span><span>가공 방법</span></span></th><th><span><span>수량</span></span></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td rowspan=\"6\"><span><span>객체 클래스</span></span></td><td><span><span>선박</span></span></td><td><span><span>Bounding Box</span></span></td><td><span><span>1,000,000</span></span></td></tr><tr><td><span><span>해상풍력</span></span></td><td><span><span>Bounding Box</span></span></td><td><span><span>300,000</span></span></td></tr><tr><td><span><span>기타 부유물</span></span></td><td><span><span>Bounding Box</span></span></td><td><span><span>80,000</span></span></td></tr><tr><td><span><span>어망부표</span></span></td><td><span><span>Bounding Box</span></span></td><td><span><span>30,000</span></span></td></tr><tr><td><span><span>등대</span></span></td><td><span><span>Bounding Box</span></span></td><td><span><span>30,000</span></span></td></tr><tr><td><span><span>부표</span></span></td><td><span><span>Bounding Box</span></span></td><td><span><span>30,000</span></span></td></tr></tbody>